  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "firebase-auth-2025-10-22",
    "name": "ExamBuzz - Firebase Authentication API",
    "description": "Firebase Authentication for Mobile Apps\n\n\u2728 **SEND ONLY THE FIREBASE TOKEN** - Backend extracts everything else!\n\nNo need to send name, email, phone, or any other data.\nJust send the Firebase ID token and you're done.\n\n**Request:**\n```json\n{\n    \"firebase_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6...\"\n}\n```\n\n**Backend automatically extracts:**\n- Name\n- Email\n- Profile Photo\n- Firebase UID\n\n**Response:**\n- Bearer access token\n- Complete user object\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Firebase Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Firebase Google Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"firebase_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjY4ZGUxNmYwMzI5YTZhZjNjYmQ1MzYwOWI1YzBiNDRlMGQ4MzYxMTMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..example_signature\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/firebase/google-login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "firebase",
                "google-login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "\ud83d\udd25 Firebase Google Login - SEND ONLY THE TOKEN!\n\n**What to send:**\n```json\n{\n    \"firebase_token\": \"YOUR_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN_HERE\"\n}\n```\n\n**That's it!** No phone, no name, no email needed.\n\n**Backend automatically extracts from Firebase:**\n- \u2705 Name (displayName)\n- \u2705 Email\n- \u2705 Profile Photo (photoUrl)  \n- \u2705 Firebase UID\n\n**Response:**\n- Bearer access token for API authentication\n- Complete user object with all extracted data\n\n**Note:** Replace the firebase_token value with an actual token from your Firebase SDK.\n"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Successful Login (Existing User)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n    \"firebase_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjY4ZGUxNmYwMzI5...\",\n    \"phone\": \"01712345678\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/firebase/google-login",
                  "host": [
                    "{{base_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "firebase",
                    "google-login"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n    \"status\": true,\n    \"message\": \"Login successful\",\n    \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n    \"access_token\": \"1|abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz123456789\",\n    \"user\": {\n        \"id\": 1,\n        \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n        \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n        \"phone\": \"01712345678\",\n        \"firebase_uid\": \"firebase_uid_12345\",\n        \"registration_id\": \"2025000001\",\n        \"status\": 1,\n        \"email_verified_at\": \"2025-10-22T10:30:00.000000Z\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2025-10-22T10:30:00.000000Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2025-10-22T10:30:00.000000Z\"\n    }\n}"
            },
