        {
          "name": "Firebase Facebook Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"firebase_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjY4ZGUxNmYwMzI5YTZhZjNjYmQ1MzYwOWI1YzBiNDRlMGQ4MzYxMTMiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..example_signature\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/firebase/facebook-login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "firebase",
                "facebook-login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "\ud83d\udd25 Firebase Facebook Login - SEND ONLY THE TOKEN!\n\n**What to send:**\n```json\n{\n    \"firebase_token\": \"YOUR_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN_HERE\"\n}\n```\n\nSame as Google login - just the token!\nBackend extracts all user information from Firebase.\n"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Successful Login",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n    \"firebase_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IjY4ZGUxNmYwMzI5...\",\n    \"phone\": \"01712345678\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/firebase/facebook-login",
                  "host": [
                    "{{base_url}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "firebase",
                    "facebook-login"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n    \"status\": true,\n    \"message\": \"Login successful\",\n    \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n    \"access_token\": \"3|abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz111222333\",\n    \"user\": {\n        \"id\": 3,\n        \"name\": \"Alice Johnson\",\n        \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n        \"phone\": \"01755555555\",\n        \"firebase_uid\": \"firebase_uid_facebook_123\",\n        \"registration_id\": \"2025000003\",\n        \"status\": 1,\n        \"email_verified_at\": \"2025-10-22T12:00:00.000000Z\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2025-10-22T12:00:00.000000Z\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"2025-10-22T12:00:00.000000Z\"\n    }\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Firebase-based authentication endpoints for mobile apps.\n\n**How it works:**\n1. Mobile app uses Firebase SDK to authenticate users (Google Sign-In or Facebook Login)\n2. Firebase SDK returns an ID token\n3. Mobile app sends the ID token to our API\n4. Our API verifies the token with Firebase\n5. API creates/logs in the user\n6. API returns a Bearer token for subsequent requests"
    },
    {
      "name": "Protected Routes Example",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get User Profile",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/user/profile",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "user",
                "profile"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Example of using the Bearer token from Firebase authentication to access protected routes.\n\nAfter successful login, use the `access_token` in the Authorization header."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Examples of how to use the Bearer token from Firebase authentication"
    }
